# U.S.S. Farragut, Bold Explorer's landfall: "you may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. That
# creature gains haste. At the beginning of the next end step, put it on the bottom of your library. When you do, draw a
# card." (CR 603.6a, 608.2d, 611.2a, 603.7c, 400.3, 603.12, 121.1)
# Bot2's Llanowar Elves is a creature card that is not in YOUR hand, so the choice never offers it and it stays in Bot2's
# hand; the Ornithopter put onto the battlefield has haste at once (no Summoning Sickness check), and at the beginning of
# the next end step it goes to the BOTTOM of Bot1's library, which draws a card.

